      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A whole-corpus INDEX (search, LSI, SQLite slices, a handler index), not a page a reviewer reads. A `preview` build puts back main's copy instead of running its writer; a `full` build (main, public comment, release) always runs it (owner, 2026-11-01: \"preview\" = no reindex, only changes). A writer is borrowed only when EVERY entry it writes says so, so marking one of a writer's pages does not skip the others. `cat-harness-tools/scripts/lib/build-type.ts`.",
