          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Entry slugs of a `library` the owner asked to hold that no methodology cites YET. The platform library holds only sources its methodologies cite (`library-ref.test.ts` in the content core); a source ingested ahead of the methodology text that will cite it is listed here, by name, until it is cited and leaves the list. Unlike {@link heldEntries} this does NOT hold the entry's summaries back: its blocks still drain. Listed, never derived, so a source cannot become admitted by accident (bean `e0jh`).",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness-tools/schemas/kg/cat-harness.ts#ContentDirectoryShape.awaitingCitation",
