      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A named sub-graph that is OFF in every layer — including the one that declares it — unless that layer enables it, by listing `<instance>.<id>` in its own `enableSubgraphs` (cat-harness#991 step 23.1; owner, 2026-11-03: `sdlc` and `work-plan` are off in every layer above cat-harness unless it enables them). Switched off, it and everything declared from within it are invisible to the resolved directories, the skill overlay, the served Tools and a mount's default list. `true` or absent: an entry that is on everywhere says nothing. See `schemas/kg/opt-in-subgraphs.ts`.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
