      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Opt-in entries only: the other opt-in sub-graphs this one cannot work without, each qualified `<instance>.<directory id>` — of this layer or its `needs` closure (owner, 2026-11-13: cat-harness's `sdlc` requires `cat-harness.work-plan`, whose skills and processes it uses). IMPLIED: wherever this sub-graph is switched on, everything it requires is switched on too, transitively, and a reference from inside it into one it requires is not dangling (`check:optin-refs`). A from-within entry (`L2/graph.json`'s `L2-collab`) may carry it too, read raw like its `optIn` (`requiresDeclared`). Checked by `check:declaration-resolution` (`requiresProblems`).",
