          "@value": "What a directory of this kind HOLDS, as the kind table states it: the editorial prose that used to be hand-written in that table's `contents` column (owner, 2026-10-04: the prose moves onto the kind, and the table is generated from it). Longer and more careful than `summary`, which stays the one line a tile or a tooltip shows.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness-tools/schemas/kg/graph-typology-registry.ts#GraphTypologyDef.description",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
