          "@value": "The steps of THIS checkout's own workflows that CI runs and the local gate set does not, each with its reason ({@link GateExemptionsSchema}). The index owns `.github/workflows/`, so it declares their exemptions, in the same change as the step — never ahead of it in a layer.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
