        {
          "@value": "The PDF carried an outline and it was not used, with why: its entries are machine bookmark names (`_GoBack`, `_Hlk62546849`, `_TOC_250000`, \"Blank Page\", a merged file's name), or too few of them name a heading the pages print (a Russian edition carrying its English outline). The contents were then inferred, as for a PDF with no outline. Absent when the outline was used or there was none.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
