        {
          "@value": "Share of the sections an inferred TOC would cut that hold under 50 characters, front matter excluded — the third trust test (issue #2302): above 25% (from 5 sections up) the tree is refused as headings without bodies. Reported whether or not it passed.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
