        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Where the entry's MATHEMATICS comes from, written by `latex-math-overlay.py`: `latex` when at least one section's text was replaced by the paper's own LaTeX, `text-layer` when the overlay ran and none passed its gates. Absent when the overlay never ran.",
